{"id":22,"role":"Tool","content":"C:\\github\\YangMills\\src\\lean\\YangMills\\Proofs\\ReflectionPositivity.lean\n-- 2618 lines, 153185 bytes --\n1140 |       exact lt_irrefl _ hneg\n1141 |   · -- Cover\n1142 |     ext l\n1143 |     simp only [interfaceLinkPos, interfaceLinkInt, interfaceLinkNeg, Finset.mem_union,\n1144 |       Finset.mem_filter, Finset.mem_univ, true_and]\n1145 |     refine ⟨fun _ => trivial, fun _ => ?_⟩\n1146 |     rcases signedTime_trichotomy T l.val.1.time with h | h | h\n1147 |     · exact Or.inl (Or.inl h)\n1148 |     · exact Or.inl (Or.inr h)\n1149 |     · exact Or.inr h\n1150 | \n1151 | /-- The partition in the form required by `interface_kernel_character_expansion`:\n1152 | `hdisj : Disjoint L_U L_0 ∧ Disjoint (L_U ∪ L_0) L_V`. -/\n1153 | lemma interfaceLinkPartition_hdisj (T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L] :\n1154 |     Disjoint (interfaceLinkPos T L) (interfaceLinkInt T L) ∧\n1155 |     Disjoint (interfaceLinkPos T L ∪ interfaceLinkInt T L) (interfaceLinkNeg T L) :=\n1156 |   ⟨interfaceLinkPartition_disjoint_cover T L |>.1,\n1157 |    interfaceLinkPartition_disjoint_cover T L |>.2.1⟩\n1158 | \n1159 | /-- The partition in the form required by `interface_kernel_character_expansion`:\n1160 | `hcover : L_U ∪ L_0 ∪ L_V = Finset.univ`. -/\n1161 | lemma interfaceLinkPartition_hcover (T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L] :\n1162 |     interfaceLinkPos T L ∪ interfaceLinkInt T L ∪ interfaceLinkNeg T L = Finset.univ :=\n1163 |   interfaceLinkPartition_disjoint_cover T L |>.2.2\n1164 | \n1165 | /-! ### Temporal/spatial split of interface links (L_0 = L_0_temporal ⊔ L_0_spatial)\n1166 | \n1167 | The interface links at time-0 (`interfaceLinkInt`, a.k.a. `L_0`) split into:\n1168 | - **Temporal** (μ=0): inverted by the σ reflection (`σ(w) = w⁻¹`).\n1169 | - **Spatial** (μ≠0): fixed by the σ reflection (`σ(u⁰_s) = u⁰_s`).\n1170 | \n1171 | This split is the key insight of §8.11.32: expanding the test function `f` in the\n1172 | Peter-Weyl basis of the temporal links ONLY (keeping spatial links as parameters)\n1173 | avoids the reorganization obstacle, because the spatial links are the same in both\n1174 | f-factors (fixed by σ) while the temporal links give a Gram matrix via the triple\n1175 | product integral (ρ(w⁻¹) = ρ(w)† provides the conjugation). -/\n1176 | \n1177 | /-- The temporal (time-like, μ=0) links among the time-0 interface links.\n1178 | Under σ, these are INVERTED: `σ(w) = w⁻¹`. -/\n1179 | noncomputable def interfaceLinkTemporal (T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L] :\n1180 |     Finset (InterfaceLink T L) :=\n1181 |   (interfaceLinkInt T L).filter (fun l => l.val.2 = 0)\n1182 | \n1183 | /-- The spatial (μ≠0) links among the time-0 interface links.\n1184 | Under σ, these are FIXED: `σ(u⁰_s) = u⁰_s`. -/\n1185 | noncomputable def interfaceLinkSpatial (T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L] :\n1186 |     Finset (InterfaceLink T L) :=\n1187 |   (interfaceLinkInt T L).filter (fun l => l.val.2 ≠ 0)\n1188 | \n1189 | /-- Membership in `interfaceLinkTemporal`: time-0 link with μ=0. -/\n1190 | lemma interfaceLinkTemporal_mem_iff (T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n1191 |     (l : InterfaceLink T L) :\n1192 |     l ∈ interfaceLinkTemporal T L ↔ l ∈ interfaceLinkInt T L ∧ l.val.2 = 0 := by\n1193 |   simp [interfaceLinkTemporal]\n1194 | \n1195 | /-- Membership in `interfaceLinkSpatial`: time-0 link with μ≠0. -/\n1196 | lemma interfaceLinkSpatial_mem_iff (T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n1197 |     (l : InterfaceLink T L) :\n1198 |     l ∈ interfaceLinkSpatial T L ↔ l ∈ interfaceLinkInt T L ∧ l.val.2 ≠ 0 := by\n1199 |   simp [interfaceLinkSpatial]\n1200 | \n1201 | /-- The temporal and spatial links partition the time-0 interface links (L_0). -/\n1202 | lemma interfaceLinkTemporal_spatial_partition (T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L] :\n1203 |     Disjoint (interfaceLinkTemporal T L) (interfaceLinkSpatial T L) ∧\n1204 |     interfaceLinkTemporal T L ∪ interfaceLinkSpatial T L = interfaceLinkInt T L := by\n1205 |   refine ⟨?_, ?_⟩\n1206 |   · refine Finset.disjoint_left.mpr (fun l hl hl' => ?_)\n1207 |     rw [interfaceLinkTemporal_mem_iff] at hl\n1208 |     rw [interfaceLinkSpatial_mem_iff] at hl'\n1209 |     exact hl'.2 hl.2\n1210 |   · ext l\n1211 |     simp only [Finset.mem_union, interfaceLinkTemporal_mem_iff,\n1212 |       interfaceLinkSpatial_mem_iff]\n1213 |     by_cases hμ : l.val.2 = 0 <;> simp [hμ]\n1214 | \n1215 | /-- The product over `interfaceLinkInt` equals the product over temporal ∪ spatial. -/\n1216 | lemma prod_interfaceLinkInt_eq_temporal_spatial (T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n1217 |     {α : Type*} [CommMonoid α] (f : InterfaceLink T L → α) :\n1218 |     ∏ l ∈ interfaceLinkInt T L, f l =\n1219 |     (∏ l ∈ interfaceLinkTemporal T L, f l) * (∏ l ∈ interfaceLinkSpatial T L, f l) := by\n1220 |   have ⟨hdisj, hcover⟩ := interfaceLinkTemporal_spatial_partition T L\n1221 |   rw [← hcover]\n1222 |   exact Finset.prod_union hdisj\n1223 | \n1224 | /-- The product over all plaquettes with an if-condition equals the product over\n1225 | interface plaquettes only (non-interface terms contribute 1).  This is the\n1226 | \"filter product\" step connecting G3 (`exp_neg_beta_wilsonActionOSInterface_eq_prod`)\n1227 | to the abstract product `∏_{p ∈ InterfacePlaquette} exp(c·Re Tr(...))`. -/\n1228 | lemma prod_if_interface_eq_prod_subtype (T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n1229 |     {α : Type*} (f : PlaquetteIndex T L → α) [CommMonoid α] :\n1230 |     ∏ n : PeriodicSite T L, ∏ μ : Fin 4, ∏ ν : Fin 4,\n1231 |         (if isInterfacePlaquette T L n μ ν then f (n, μ, ν) else 1) =\n1232 |     ∏ p : InterfacePlaquette T L, f p.val := by\n1233 |   classical\n1234 |   -- Merge the three nested products into one over `PlaquetteIndex T L`.\n1235 |   -- `simp only` does a bottom-up traversal, so it rewrites the innermost\n1236 |   -- `∏ μ, ∏ ν` first (→ `∏ q : Fin 4 × Fin 4`) and then `∏ n, ∏ q`\n1237 |   -- (→ `∏ p : PeriodicSite T L × (Fin 4 × Fin 4)`), producing the\n1238 |   -- *right-associated* product type `PlaquetteIndex T L`.\n1239 |   simp only [← Fintype.prod_prod_type']\n1240 |   -- Now: ∏ p : PlaquetteIndex T L,\n1241 |   --   (if isInterfacePlaquette T L p.1 p.2.1 p.2.2 then f (p.1, p.2.1, p.2.2) else 1)\n1242 |   -- Convert the if-product to a filtered product (non-interface terms are 1).\n1243 |   rw [← Finset.prod_filter]\n1244 |   -- Now: ∏ p ∈ Finset.univ.filter (isInterfacePlaquette …), f (p.1, p.2.1, p.2.2)\n1245 |   -- Convert the filtered product to a product over the subtype `InterfacePlaquette`.\n1246 |   -- (f (p.1, p.2.1, p.2.2) = f p by Prod-eta, and Subtype cond = InterfacePlaquette.)\n1247 |   exact Finset.prod_subtype _ (fun x => by\n1248 |     simp only [Finset.mem_filter, Finset.mem_univ, true_and]) (fun p => f p)\n1249 | \n1250 | #print axioms prod_if_interface_eq_prod_subtype\n1251 | \n1252 | /-- **Interface Boltzmann factor as a positive constant times the abstract plaquette\n1253 | product.** The concrete interface Boltzmann factor `exp(-β·S_int)` equals a positive\n1254 | constant `C = ∏_{p ∈ InterfacePlaquette} exp(-β²)` times the abstract plaquette product\n1255 | `∏_{p ∈ InterfacePlaquette} exp((β²/N)·Re Tr(g₀g₁g₂⁻¹g₃⁻¹))`, where the plaquette product\n1256 | is expressed via the concrete link structures (`interfaceLinkVar`, `interfaceLinkAssign`).\n1257 | \n1258 | This combines G3 (`exp_neg_beta_wilsonActionOSInterface_eq_prod_abstract`),\n1259 | `prod_if_interface_eq_prod_subtype` (restrict to interface plaquettes), and\n1260 | `plaquetteProduct_interface_eq` (concrete→abstract plaquette product).  The constant\n1261 | `C > 0` is absorbable into normalization.  This is sub-step (ii) of Lemma 2\n1262 | (`transfer_matrix_integral_reduction`) in\n1263 | `docs/transfer_matrix_positivity_design.md` §8.8: rewriting the concrete interface\n1264 | Boltzmann factor into the abstract form that `interface_kernel_character_expansion`\n1265 | operates on.  Pure algebra — 0 sorries, 0 custom axioms. -/\n1266 | lemma interface_boltzmann_eq_abstract_product (N T L : ℕ) (β : ℝ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L] :\n1267 |     ∃ (C : ℝ) (hC : 0 < C),\n1268 |       ∀ (U : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L)),\n1269 |       Real.exp (-β * wilsonActionOSInterface N T L β U) =\n\n... 1349 more line(s) below (use offset=1270 to continue reading)\nTime: 2026-08-05 07:47:14 UTC","timestamp":1785916034,"token_count":2538,"tool_call_id":"cf7346c0-86de-4b6f-b57c-3da04dd63342","full_token_estimate":1677,"tool_meta":{"tool_name":"read_file","file_path":"src/lean/YangMills/Proofs/ReflectionPositivity.lean","old_text":null,"new_text":null,"exit_code":null,"line_count":2618,"byte_count":153185,"is_error":false,"duration_ms":0,"edit_line":null},"turn":9,"is_prune_marker":false}
