{"id":26,"role":"Tool","content":"C:\\github\\YangMills\\src\\lean\\YangMills\\Proofs\\TransferMatrix.lean\n-- 5709 lines, 276989 bytes --\n1820 |       else\n1821 |         V_plus ⟨(ReflectSite.reflectSite n, μ),\n1822 |           reflectSite_mem_positive_of_negative hT hneg⟩ := by\n1823 |   have hpos : ReflectSite.reflectSite n ∈ positiveSites T L :=\n1824 |     reflectSite_mem_positive_of_negative hT hneg\n1825 |   simp only [reflectPosToNeg, restrictLinkVariable, reflectLinkVariable, extendLinkVariable]\n1826 |   simp only [dif_pos hpos]\n1827 | \n1828 | #print axioms reflectPosToNeg_apply\n1829 | \n1830 | /-- The σ reflection on interface configurations: inverts time-like links, keeps spatial.\n1831 | This is the restriction of `reflectLinkVariable` to interface sites (which are fixed by\n1832 | `reflectSite` since their time coordinate is 0). -/\n1833 | noncomputable def sigmaInterface\n1834 |     (U_zero : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (interfaceSites T L)) :\n1835 |     FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (interfaceSites T L) :=\n1836 |   restrictLinkVariable N (PeriodicSite T L) (interfaceSites T L)\n1837 |     (reflectLinkVariable N (extendLinkVariable N (PeriodicSite T L) (interfaceSites T L) U_zero))\n1838 | \n1839 | /-- **σ-action on individual interface links.** For a link `(n, μ)` at an interface\n1840 | site `n` (signedTime=0), `sigmaInterface` gives:\n1841 | - **Temporal** (μ=0): the link value at the reflected site, **inverted**.\n1842 | - **Spatial** (μ≠0): the link value at the reflected site, **unchanged**.\n1843 | \n1844 | This is the key property underlying §8.11.32: the σ reflection inverts temporal\n1845 | interface links (w → w⁻¹, giving ρ(w⁻¹) = ρ(w)† for the Peter-Weyl conjugation)\n1846 | while keeping spatial interface links fixed. -/\n1847 | lemma sigmaInterface_apply (hT : Odd T)\n1848 |     (U_zero : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (interfaceSites T L))\n1849 |     (n : PeriodicSite T L) (hn : n ∈ interfaceSites T L) (μ : Fin 4) :\n1850 |     sigmaInterface N T L U_zero ⟨(n, μ), hn⟩ =\n1851 |       if hμ : μ = 0 then\n1852 |         (U_zero ⟨(ReflectSite.reflectSite n, μ),\n1853 |           reflectSite_mem_interface_of_interface hT hn⟩)⁻¹\n1854 |       else\n1855 |         U_zero ⟨(ReflectSite.reflectSite n, μ),\n1856 |           reflectSite_mem_interface_of_interface hT hn⟩ := by\n1857 |   have h_reflect_int : ReflectSite.reflectSite n ∈ interfaceSites T L :=\n1858 |     reflectSite_mem_interface_of_interface hT hn\n1859 |   unfold sigmaInterface restrictLinkVariable reflectLinkVariable extendLinkVariable\n1860 |   by_cases hμ : μ = 0\n1861 |   · subst hμ; simp [h_reflect_int]\n1862 |   · simp [h_reflect_int, hμ]\n1863 | \n1864 | #print axioms sigmaInterface_apply\n1865 | \n1866 | set_option maxHeartbeats 1000000 in\n1867 | /-- Reflecting the negative config `reflectPosToNeg(V⁺)` back to the positive+interface\n1868 | region recovers `V⁺` on positive links and `σ(u⁰)` on interface links.\n1869 | \n1870 | This is the key involution property for the change of variables in step (b):\n1871 | `reflectToPosInterface(reflectPosToNeg(V⁺), u⁰) = mergePosInterface(V⁺, σ(u⁰))`. -/\n1872 | lemma reflectToPosInterface_involution (hT : Odd T)\n1873 |     (V_plus : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (positiveSites T L))\n1874 |     (U_zero : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (interfaceSites T L)) :\n1875 |     reflectToPosInterface N T L (reflectPosToNeg N T L V_plus) U_zero =\n1876 |     mergePosInterface N T L V_plus (sigmaInterface N T L U_zero) := by\n1877 |   ext x\n1878 |   rcases x with ⟨⟨n, μ⟩, hx⟩\n1879 |   dsimp [reflectToPosInterface, reflectPosToNeg, sigmaInterface, mergePosInterface,\n1880 |     linkVariableRestrict, reflectLinkVariable, restrictLinkVariable, extendLinkVariable,\n1881 |     mergeConfigurations]\n1882 |   by_cases hn_pos : n ∈ positiveSites T L\n1883 |   · -- Positive case: result should be V_plus(n, μ)\n1884 |     have h_reflect_neg := reflectSite_mem_negative_of_positive hT hn_pos\n1885 |     have h_reflect_not_pos := reflectSite_not_mem_positive_of_positive hT hn_pos\n1886 |     by_cases hμ : μ = 0\n1887 |     · subst hμ\n1888 |       simp [hn_pos, h_reflect_neg, h_reflect_not_pos, ReflectSite.involution, inv_inv]\n1889 |     · simp [hn_pos, h_reflect_neg, h_reflect_not_pos, hμ, ReflectSite.involution]\n1890 |   · -- Interface case: result should be sigmaInterface U_zero(n, μ)\n1891 |     have hint : n ∈ interfaceSites T L := by\n1892 |       rcases Finset.mem_union.mp hx with (h | h)\n1893 |       · exact absurd h hn_pos\n1894 |       · exact h\n1895 |     have h_reflect_int := reflectSite_mem_interface_of_interface hT hint\n1896 |     have h_reflect_not_pos := reflectSite_not_mem_positive_of_interface hT hint\n1897 |     have h_reflect_not_neg := reflectSite_not_mem_negative_of_interface hT hint\n1898 |     by_cases hμ : μ = 0\n1899 |     · subst hμ\n1900 |       simp [hn_pos, h_reflect_int, h_reflect_not_pos, h_reflect_not_neg]\n1901 |     · simp [hn_pos, h_reflect_int, h_reflect_not_pos, h_reflect_not_neg, hμ]\n1902 | \n1903 | #print axioms reflectToPosInterface_involution\n1904 | \n1905 | /-- The reflection map from negative-time configurations to positive-time configurations.\n1906 | This is the forward change-of-variables map `U⁻ ↦ V⁺ = reflect(U⁻)` used in step (b).\n1907 | `reflectPosToNeg` is its inverse. -/\n1908 | noncomputable def reflectNegToPos\n1909 |     (U_minus : FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (negativeSites T L)) :\n1910 |     FiniteLinkConfig N (PeriodicSite T L) (positiveSites T L) :=\n1911 |   restrictLinkVariable N (PeriodicSite T L) (positiveSites T L)\n1912 |     (reflectLinkVariable N (extendLinkVariable N (PeriodicSite T L) (negativeSites T L) U_minus))\n1913 | \n1914 | set_option maxHeartbeats 1000000 in\n1915 | /-- `reflectPosToNeg` is the left-inverse of `reflectNegToPos`: reflecting a negative\n1916 | config to positive and back recovers the original. This follows from `reflec