_plus (sigmaInterface N T L u0)) *\n\n... 1190 more line(s) below (use offset=4520 to continue reading)\nTime: 2026-08-05 08:47:43 UTC","timestamp":1785919663,"token_count":1253,"tool_call_id":"efcbd323-b8f9-4ceb-b7d9-1165b30bf6d8","full_token_estimate":840,"tool_meta":{"tool_name":"read_file","file_path":"src/lean/YangMills/Proofs/TransferMatrix.lean","old_text":null,"new_text":null,"exit_code":null,"line_count":5709,"byte_count":276989,"is_error":false,"duration_ms":0,"edit_line":null},"turn":41,"is_prune_marker":false}
{"id":76,"role":"Tool","content":"Searched for \"multi_link_gram_psd_nonneg|def multi_link_gram\" in C:\\github\\YangMills\\src\\lean\\YangMills\\Proofs\\PeterWeyl.lean\n4 match(es):\nPeterWeyl.lean:1621: lemma multi_link_gram_psd_nonneg\nPeterWeyl.lean:1686: #print axioms multi_link_gram_psd_nonneg\nPeterWeyl.lean:1697: Gram matrix quadratic form (≥ 0 by `multi_link_gram_psd_nonneg`), and the weights `F(w) ≥ 0`\nPeterWeyl.lean:1718:     multi_link_gram_psd_nonneg (A w) (d w)\nTime: 2026-08-05 08:47:43 UTC","timestamp":1785919663,"token_count":138,"tool_call_id":"98b98799-3dba-49b2-a134-f4ffc6620654","full_token_estimate":115,"tool_meta":{"tool_name":"grep","file_path":"src/lean/YangMills/Proofs/PeterWeyl.lean","old_text":"multi_link_gram_psd_nonneg|def multi_link_gram","new_text":null,"exit_code":null,"line_count":4,"byte_count":null,"is_error":false,"duration_ms":1,"edit_line":null},"turn":41,"is_prune_marker":false}
